"F06569"	"tests/PhotoReview.Core.Tests/Abstractions/NullLogTests.cs"	"8"	"21"	"MethodDeclaration"	"NullLogTests.[Fact] public void NullLogMethodsDoNotThrow()"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Invokes all three severity methods including exception then asserts no thrown error; intentionally does not verify writing since NullLog is no-op. Mutation checks not run. BODY: [Fact] public void NullLogMethodsDoNotThrow() { var log = NullLog.Instance; var thrown = Record.Exception(() => { log.Info(""test info""); log.Warn(""test warn""); log.Error(""test error"", new InvalidOperationException()); }); Assert.Null(thrown); }"
