"F09497"	"tests/PhotoReview.Core.Tests/Settings/SettingsParseTextTests.cs"	"136"	"146"	"MethodDeclaration"	"SettingsParseTextTests.public static TheoryData<string> EquivalenceInputs()"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Data set covers salvage/migration/conflict/null/future schema, but contains no fontNaN/negative step; input helper has no independent oracle. Mutation checks not run. BODY: public static TheoryData<string> EquivalenceInputs() => [ """"""{""ConfigVersion"":3,""UiLanguage"":""en""}"""""", """"""{""ConfigVersion"":3,""ClickZoomPercent"":""abc"",""Shortcuts"":{""Next"":""N""},""Actions"":[{""Name"":""Mine"",""Shortcut"":""K""}]}"""""", """"""{""ConfigVersion"":3,""LoadingMode"":""Bogus"",""ClickZoomPercent"":999999}"""""", """"""{""KeyboardZoomStepPercent"":40}"""""", """"""{""ConfigVersion"":3,""Actions"":[{""Name"":""Mine"",""Shortcut"":""K""}]}"""""", """"""{""ConfigVersion"":3,""Actions"":null,""Shortcuts"":null}"""""", """"""{""ConfigVersion"":99,""FutureThing"":1}"""""", ""null"", ];"
"F09498"	"tests/PhotoReview.Core.Tests/Settings/SettingsParseTextTests.cs"	"148"	"163"	"MethodDeclaration"	"SettingsParseTextTests.[Theory] [MemberData(nameof(EquivalenceInputs))] public void ParseTextAndLoad_SameFileText_GiveIdenticalSettingsAndRepairs(string text)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Data set covers salvage/migration/conflict/null/future schema, but contains no fontNaN/negative step; input helper has no independent oracle. Mutation checks not run. BODY: [Theory] [MemberData(nameof(EquivalenceInputs))] public void ParseTextAndLoad_SameFileText_GiveIdenticalSettingsAndRepairs(string text) { var fs = new InMemoryFileSystem(); const string path = @""C:\cfg\other.json""; // an explicit path: Load does not write repairs back fs.AddFile(path, text); var store = new SettingsStore(new AppPaths(@""C:\Users\test\AppData\Local""), fs, NullLog.Instance); var loaded = store.Load(path); var parsed = SettingsStore.ParseText(text); Assert.Equal(JsonSerializer.Serialize(loaded, AppSettingsJsonContext.Default.AppSettings), JsonSerializer.Serialize(parsed.Settings, AppSettingsJsonContext.Default.AppSettings)); Assert.Equal(store.LastLoadRepairs, parsed.Repairs); }"
