"F13031"	"tests/PhotoReview.Imaging.Tests/Raw/RawDecoderNoPreviewFallbackTests.cs"	"22"	"23"	"MethodDeclaration"	"RawDecoderNoPreviewFallbackTests.private static string WriteRawWithoutPreview(TempRoot temp, string name)"	"STATIC-ONLY"	"Member RawDecoderNoPreviewFallbackTests.private static string WriteRawWithoutPreview(TempRoot temp, string name); enclosing test/helper/lambda semantic review: Oracle exercises typed no-preview error, fallback thumbnail/full-decoder routing, exact fake call counts and embedded-preview dimensions using synthetic TIFF/JPEG fixtures; Native Leica DNG case is conditional and unrun. FullDecoder fake delegates to WPF decode of generated JPEG, so it validates orchestration rather than LibRaw sensor output. This records read bodies and oracle assessment, not runtime PASS."
